*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
