**1 [[Katsumi Orochi (Enemy)|Katsumi Orochi]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

