==Strategy==
The main goal is to outlast all of the Angelic Gories and Aku Gories, while making sure Katsumi doesn't push too hard. Since knocking back the Gories will have your units die from Katsumi's attacks, you'll have to constantly replace your offensive units. The best attackers here are ones that have good amounts of health to allow them to survive a Katsumi hit, like [[Pizza Cat]]. Remember to use Talented [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] only for the second or third waves of Gories. The second wave has two Aku Gories and one Angelic Gory, while the third wave spawns a while after that and has three Aku Gories. Which one you want to Baha Blast on is up to you.
